  "children": [
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "screen-main",
      "name": "Screen / Main",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "screen-main-title",
          "name": "Main",
          "content": "Main",
          "fill": "$--foreground",
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": "$--text-headline",
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "screen-main-spec",
          "name": "web/src/App.tsx, sidebar.tsx",
          "content": "web/src/App.tsx, sidebar.tsx, MainScreen.tsx, TaskBoards.tsx, projectBoard.ts: All projects, the scope the sidebar’s top row opens. Its title carries Add project and 새 이슈 as the primary action (C); its facts line the project count, the open issues once every source has answered, and the open-PR and merged totals only when every project can give its part; its Tasks · Agents · Projects tabs the count of agents waiting on the operator on Agents. Every project’s issues and worktrees share one board, 백로그 · 진행 중 · 리뷰 · 완료, each card with its project beside its id (a Local issue as L-N, a primary checkout as a house): 시작 on a backlog card under the pointer, the needs-you cards in the warning border, the idle worktrees folded at the foot of 진행 중, and 완료 folded to one line per project with its count. Every project has an issue source, so no project is set apart as unconnected. Its Dependencies mode draws an arrow that crosses projects, the blocker named with its repository on the lock line. The Projects view is the project list grouped by device.",
          "fill": "$--muted-foreground",
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": "$--text-caption",
          "fontWeight": "400",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 960
        },
