        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "screen-project-overview-spec",
          "name": "web/src/ProjectOverview.tsx,",
          "content": "web/src/ProjectOverview.tsx, TaskBoards.tsx, projectBoard.ts, components/agent-row.tsx: a project’s Overview, issue first. The header carries the path back, New agent as the quiet action and 새 이슈 as the primary one (C), the facts line starting with the open issues and their source, and the Tasks · Agents · Sessions tabs with the count of agents waiting on the operator in warning on Agents; there is no waiting band. The Tasks board is four columns, 백로그 · 진행 중 · 리뷰 · 완료, on a page that scrolls as one. 백로그 always stands with + in its head, and a backlog card offers 시작 S under the pointer. A card reads its source glyph and id (or, with no issue, its branch), the title in at most two lines, the lock line, then the PR chip with its CI mark and review word, the branch, ↑N and N files, then at most two agents on the sidebar agent row and +N 에이전트. A needs-you card wears the warning border; a worktree with no issue leads with its branch and offers 이슈 연결 and ⋯ under the pointer; the worktrees with no issue and no agent fold into one line at the foot of 진행 중; 완료 starts folded to branch names. Beside it, the Dependencies mode (the same cards with a stage word, blockers left of what they block, a blocked card dimmed, unrelated tasks below) and the Agents inbox, rows grouped 내 차례 · 실행 중 · 쉬는 중 · 정리할 것: the mark, provider and title, the line an agent asks or reports, and on the right its issue id or checkout, its PR chip and its age, a delegated agent one step in under its parent.",
